description:
Design a binary to Binary-Coded Decimal (BCD) converter. This module takes a 4-bit binary input and converts it into a 2-digit BCD representation, where BCD_HI represents the higher four bits (tens place) and BCD_LO represents the lower four bits (units place). The conversion is accomplished in two stages: first, an adjustment of the binary input is made, and then a conditional correction is applied if the intermediate value exceeds 9, ensuring that the output conforms to valid BCD representation.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] BIN,
    output reg [3:0] BCD_HI,
    output reg [3:0] BCD_LO
);

